\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a><a aria-label=\"Claude is now available in Brazil\" href=\"/news/claude-brazil\"><circle cx=\"177.18294155267623\" cy=\"43.5989676552238\" r=\"16.733126291998992\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a><a aria-label=\"Introducing Claude to Canada\" href=\"/news/introducing-claude-to-canada\"><circle cx=\"145.57935167693543\" cy=\"23.476015842581933\" r=\"16.733126291998992\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a><a aria-label=\"Claude is now available in Europe\" href=\"/news/claude-europe\"><circle cx=\"27.37504\" cy=\"81.50136227652929\" r=\"16.733126291998992\" fill=\"transparent\" class=\"_74-EFW_nodeHit\"></circle></a></svg></div></div><div class=\"tOQyXa_headline-6 yApI1G_headline\" data-component=\"Headline\">Related articles</div><ul class=\"yApI1G_list\"><li><div class=\"yApI1G_card _8J1zJG_card\"><header class=\"_8J1zJG_cardHeader\"><div class=\"_8J1zJG_eyebrowsWrapper\"><p>Economics</p><p>Feb 16, 2026</p></div></header><div class=\"_8J1zJG_text\" data-lines=\"3\" style=\"--text-lines:3\"><a class=\"_8J1zJG_link\" href=\"/research/india-brief-economic-index\">India Country Brief: The Anthropic Economic Index</a></div></div></li></ul><a data-component=\"AnchorButton\" data-variant=\"tertiary\" class=\"f9ZZrG_button f9ZZrG_corner-small f9ZZrG_variant-tertiary f9ZZrG_size-small f9ZZrG_icon-format-trailing yApI1G_cta\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"/search?topic=claude-apps\">View more<span class=\"f9ZZrG_icon\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.1465 4.64648C11.3417 4.45127 11.6582 4.45136 11.8535 4.64648L16.8535 9.64649L16.916 9.72267C16.9703 9.80418 17 9.90061 17 10C17 10.1326 16.9473 10.2598 16.8535 10.3535L11.8535 15.3535C11.6583 15.5486 11.3417 15.5487 11.1465 15.3535C10.9513 15.1583 10.9514 14.8418 11.1465 14.6465L15.293 10.5H3.5C3.2239 10.5 3.00006 10.2761 3 10C3 9.72387 3.22386 9.50001 3.5 9.50001H15.293L11.1465 5.35352C10.9514 5.15826 10.9513 4.8417 11.1465 4.64648Z\"></path></svg></span></a></div></aside></div><div class=\"PA4F1q_body\" data-article-body=\"true\" data-theme=\"ivory\"><div class=\"PA4F1q_media-column\" data-type=\"image\"><figure class=\"Duq99q_e-imageWithCaption\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"2880\" height=\"1620\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/sites/anthropic/pages-assets/67f54de8dd82969083df.webp\"><figcaption class=\"RMuY0W_root -LJkNq_container -LJkNq_container--default\" data-component=\"RichTextWrapper\"><div class=\"tOQyXa_caption-1 -LJkNq_text\" data-component=\"Caption\"></div></figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">Today, we’re introducing a paid plan for our <a id=\"base-ui-_R_3oidrpbsnpfkq6btb_\" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=\"\" href=\"https://claude.ai/\">Claude.ai</a>&nbsp;chat experience, currently available in the US and UK.<br><br>Since launching in July, users tell us they’ve chosen Claude.ai as their day-to-day AI assistant for its longer context windows, faster outputs, complex reasoning capabilities, and more.&nbsp;Many also shared that they would value more file uploads and conversations over longer periods.<br><br>With <a id=\"base-ui-_R_3r2drpbsnpfkq6btb_\" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=\"\" href=\"https://claude.ai/settings/billing?action=subscribe\">Claude Pro</a>, subscribers can now gain <strong>5x more usage</strong> of our latest model, Claude 2, for a monthly price of $20 (US) or £18 (UK).<br><br>This means you can level up your productivity across a range of tasks, including summarizing research papers, querying contracts, and iterating further on coding projects—like this recent <a id=\"base-ui-_R_3t2drpbsnpfkq6btb_\" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=\"\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oVsHikXgK9Y\">demo</a> of building an interactive map.</p><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">Claude Pro offers:</p><ul class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column text-body-1-serif post-text\"><li>5x more usage than our free tier provides, with the ability to send many more messages</li><li>Priority access to Claude.ai during high-traffic periods</li><li>Early access to new features that help you get the most out of Claude</li></ul><p class=\"PA4F1q_reading-column post-text\">You can learn more about these benefits, including how to maximize your usage, <a id=\"base-ui-_R_1sldrpbsnpfkq6btb_\" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=\"\" href=\"https://support.anthropic.com/en/articles/8324991-about-claude-pro-usage\">here</a>.<br><br>We’re grateful for your support as we strive to build helpful, honest, and harmless systems that fuel productivity and inspire creativity.<br></p></div></div></article></div><!--$--><!--/$-->","canvases":0}